<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "環境音\山の中.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "5000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家庭夜2.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>Kogori-senpai<STYLE ID="1"> is on the phone with her parents in a room on the second floor.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> is at the meeting hall, preparing for tomorrow's funeral.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">And I'm just sitting here.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Just swinging my legs on the veranda.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\最後の声から\枯れ木.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">The Niimura main house's cherry tree, grown so much shorter.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">It's shorter because the tree itself fell down underground.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Droga was being made from this tree's roots.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">This Arata cherry... what is it?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">There are countless plants that drugs can be refined from.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The raw material of opium: poppy seeds.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The raw material of marijuana: cannabis.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">And the raw material of ephedrine and methamphetamine: the cherry.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">No, the idea that cherry trees contain ephedrine is nothing more than a popular belief.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">But there's no smoke without fire.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">How did a popular belief like that come about?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">These days it has </STYLE><STYLE ID="3" RUBY="まんえん">spread</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> everywhere, told so plausibly that it passes for fact.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I won't be </STYLE><STYLE ID="4" RUBY="だま">deceived</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> by something like that.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I... won't be </STYLE><STYLE ID="4" RUBY="だま">deceived</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">The truth is already right in front of me.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">It's already right in front of me.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">There's no need to overthink it.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The truth was simply right </STYLE><STYLE ID="5" RUBY="もと">under</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> the lighthouse.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\砂利を歩く.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "500" "0"}
{CHGVOL "VOICE" "1000" "5000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "5000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">?"</STYLE>
{STOPSND "VOICE" "500" "PASS"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家庭夜2.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">The one who appeared on the veranda was </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"What's wrong?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Mm... I forgot the matches."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I go on staring hard at </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家居間.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">"Mm... where were they..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> rummages through the chest of drawers and the little storage boxes.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">Chiga-nee's</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> search is for something small, but mine is not.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Something invisible, and far too big.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">And it's―right in front of me.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">So I keep staring hard at it.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">"Mm... Did I do something wrong to you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, I've felt like you've been </STYLE><STYLE ID="8" RUBY="にら">glaring</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> at me this whole time... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">You were looking at me just now too, weren't you?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"That's just what I'm thinking, showing all too plainly."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Mm... What do you mean?"</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\z50.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="7">"I can't let the truth in front of me slip past."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, what are you saying?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"It's just the two of us here. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">There's no point playing dumb, is there?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Mm... I can't find the matches. Maybe they're on the second floor."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">"The goal of the culprit of the curse-killings. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">It was to draw suspicion away."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"............"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> went on being suspected as the one who killed </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">Then all it took was for there to be no one left to suspect him. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">That way, the family would never lose </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> being the real culprit or not didn't matter. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> being treated as the culprit and gone for good was what couldn't be borne."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱うつむき逆.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, what on earth are you―"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"I still don't know who cut </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Sakura-san's</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> neck. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">But the curse-killings after that happened in order to draw suspicion away from </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"Mm... So what you're saying is, someone wanted to protect </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> even if it meant killing people."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"With exceptional athletic ability, killing would have been possible as well."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Mm... I'll be going now."</STYLE><PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "SE" "0" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<STYLE ID="11">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="12">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="11">! There's no one but </STYLE><STYLE ID="12">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="11">!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\ナイフを構える.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島横顔逆.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱横顔ナイフ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "200" "B" "100" "32" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">At my throat, a cold sensation.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">At my throat, the cold sensation of a blade.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">At the same time, my thoughts are cold too.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">No fear, no panic.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I only </STYLE><STYLE ID="13" RUBY="にら">glare</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> at the truth in front of me.</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "bittersweet.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="7">"I can take this as a confession, right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Be quiet..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"I don't think you did it purely out of selfish desire, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"Be quiet!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">　Or else...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Or else?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"That neck of yours..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"This neck of mine?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">... Please understand. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="14">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">―I can't let them grieve any more than this."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"I see. If the truth is known, some people will end up unhappy. That makes sense."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"............"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> had been judged the culprit by some people. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> getting caught would mean losing family again."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"If you understand... then just stop..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"It was decided that </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> would be watched at the meeting hall. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">If you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, killed someone while that was going on, </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> would be cleared of suspicion."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Don't spell out every detail..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"Until the suspicion was cleared, you kept killing every year."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"I'm telling you to stop...!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"But because of the curse-killings that happened every year, the residents came to distrust one another. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, you went to Tokyo, and the curse-killings started happening even with you doing nothing."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n3\r\n100\r\n200\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
<STYLE ID="6">"Be quiet!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> presses the knife harder against my neck.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"Someone among them committed the curse-killings, and then, the other day, tried to kill us. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, were you even counting on </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> killing us?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"No!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"If the curse-killings didn't end now, this time it might be you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, who came under suspicion. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">So this time, to protect </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">yourself</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, you needed </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> caught. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">And for that, you brought us here―"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"No!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, you can't do anything. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">If you lay a hand on me, you'll be arrested too, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">Then what happens to </STYLE><STYLE ID="14">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">She'll be all alone."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Please, just be quiet...!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"Then who was it that killed </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Huh?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> came under suspicion, and from then on, it all adds up with you as the culprit, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">Then, the one who killed </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">no, even if it was suicide, who was it that cut her neck?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"That's what I want to know too...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">　If I'd known, I could have cleared </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> of suspicion...!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">For a while, I stay locked in a glaring match with </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"I... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> as the culprit―I still don't believe it, even now...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">　Because...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Because?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">　Because what?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\ナイフを構える.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\イラスト\最後の声編\茅萱睨み.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物2,人物1" "33" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> puts one more knife to my neck.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Opening those blue and green eyeballs wide, she </STYLE><STYLE ID="13" RUBY="にら">glares</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> at me.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">This is clear proof that </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> has no murderous intent.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">If she meant to kill, one knife would be enough, and the work would be done in a single second.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">She drew a second one only because she thought there wasn't enough intimidation.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> doesn't want to kill me. She wants to shut me up.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> kills me, and the family collapses completely.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="14">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> is left all alone.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> can't kill me.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">This glaring match is nothing but a farce.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">―Perhaps realizing what I intended, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> put the knives away.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家居間.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱うつむき.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, how did you carry out the curse-killings?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"With a knife, something like that is easily managed..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"You were skillful, then, for no one to ever find out. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">Did you have accomplices?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"I had no accomplices..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Really?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Really... If anything, it's easier on my own."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">But... even so, it's far too convenient.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> leaves for Tokyo, and after that, the residents kill one another.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Would something that convenient really happen every year?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">It's far too neat.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, you're hiding something important, aren't you?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">"Something important...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, there must be something only you know. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">Please tell me. What are you hiding?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Nothing..."</STYLE><PG>
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="11">"That's a lie!</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{PAUSE ""}
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="11">　Spit it out!</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{PAUSE ""}
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="11">　Don't you hide it!"</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\down1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">As if pushed down by my shouting, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> dropped to her hands and knees.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Then her whole body starts to tremble, and a grating </STYLE><STYLE ID="15" RUBY="おえつ">sobbing</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, like nothing I've ever heard before, echoes out.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Just like a child's, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Chiga-nee's</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> crude, innocent </STYLE><STYLE ID="15" RUBY="おえつ">sobbing</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> shakes my eardrums at an unpleasant wavelength.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\サード\茅萱土下座.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">"I...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">　I...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">　Since the day I was born... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">I've had a cursed body."</STYLE>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Huh?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, look closely. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">My eyes―"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\Abyss～深淵に至る窓～.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\オッドアイ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">Chiga-nee's</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> tears reflect the color of those eyes.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Tears and eyes, shining like a star at the far end of the universe.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">When she blinks and her eyelids cover those eyes, colorless tears run down her cheeks.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"I was born with the fate of killing people. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">These eyes kill people―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">the proof of the curse-killing."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"............?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"Shiyo 790―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">When I was 10, </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> died. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Whether it was suicide or she was killed, I still don't know. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">But... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">if she was killed―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="10">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> had more than just one person trying to kill her."</STYLE><PG>
{DELETECG "000" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{}
